# Route: guide 22 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 42 to 44, 23
# quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Desolace, Teldrassil, Loch Modan): Nijel's Point -> Sargeron ->
# Nijel's Point -> Thunder Axe Fortress -> Nijel's Point -> Ethel Rethor ->
# Gelkis Village -> Mannoroc Coven -> Nijel's Point -> Ranazjar Isle -> Gelkis
# Village -> Magram Village -> Gelkis Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Khan Hratha (1380; Khan Hratha
# 42); Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard
# Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan
# Deepshadow 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Legends of Maraudon (7044), The Pariah's Instructions
# (7067), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199).

